  "custom": {
    "about_page": {
      "story_heading": "OUR STORY",
      "story_text": "Founded in Dubai, Zaria is a modern house of luxury perfumery, blending timeless artistry with contemporary elegance. It is the newest venture from the leadership behind Extravaganza one of the Middle East's most established names in prestige beauty born of that same expertise, but devoted to something more intimate: the world's finest niche fragrance houses, and the collectors who seek them.",
      "md_role": "CHAIRMAN",
      "md_intro": "With a passion for artistry and a commitment to excellence, our Managing Director has curated a collection that celebrates the finest in luxury perfumery. Each fragrance tells a story, and every bottle is a testament to our dedication to quality and distinction.",
