      "artistry_heading": "ARTISTRY MEETS SOUL",
      "philosophy_text": "At Zaria, we believe fragrance is more than a scent — it is an expression of individuality, emotion, and memory. We bring the refinement of French perfumery together with the warmth and fragrance heritage of the UAE.",
